        "idea_title": "Rapid Supply Chain De-risking & Vulnerability Mapping",
        "idea_summary": "This idea aims to immediately identify and understand critical dependencies in semiconductor supply chains for essential national infrastructure. By mapping vulnerabilities and establishing preliminary response mechanisms, non-aligned nations can reduce immediate risks and build a foundational understanding for future strategic investments.",
