ssments, HR will begin designing the first wave of targeted training programs focusing on critical AI literacy and human-AI collaboration skills.\n\n**Justification:** This task is part of the Formalizing AI/DAO Governance & Workforce Transformation for Hybrid Collaboration initiative. This initiative is critical for scaling the responsible and effective integration of AI agents and DAOs into the organization's core operations. Building on near-term pilot learnings, formalizing gove... Given its strategic importance and operational feasibility, this task has been prioritized to ensure effective implementation.\n\n---\n\n### 5. **Pilot Smart Contract Review Process:** Select a low-stakes internal smart contract (e.g., for an internal micro-DAO) to test the newly established legal and technical review process, gathering feedback for refinement.\n\n**Justification:** This task is part of the Formalizing AI/DAO Governance & Workforce Transformation for Hybrid Collaboration initiative. This initiative is critical for scaling the responsible and effective integration of AI agents and DAOs into the organization's core operations. Building on near-term pilot learnings, formalizing gove... Given its strategic importance and operational feasibility, this task has been prioritized to ensure effective implementation.\n\n---\n\n# Long-Term (5\u201310 years)\n\n### 1. **Form Executive-Level Advocacy & Policy Engagement Team:** Designate senior leaders and legal/public affairs specialists to actively engage with national and international policy discussions and industry consortia regarding AI and DAO regulatory frameworks.\n\n**Justification:** This task is part of the Shaping External Ecosystems & Redesigning for Modular, Decentralized Operations initiative. This initiative represents the organization's ultimate transformation, fundamentally redefining \"the firm\" by integrating autonomous AI agents and DAOs into a modular, decentralized corporate structur... Given its strategic